 too aware of Hud's reckless amorality to bear him anymore. In the world of the takers and the taken, Hud is a winner. He's a cheat, but, he explains, \"I always say the law was meant to be interpreted in a lenient manner.\"","tagline":"The man with the barbed-wire soul."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iEUKsK0EzVjI4004HVSPnH6JVgs.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dlmROevxOVYtZXRUzt6DGJzl9BL.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":24748,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iEUKsK0EzVjI4004HVSPnH6JVgs.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iEUKsK0EzVjI4004HVSPnH6JVgs.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iEUKsK0EzVjI4004HVSPnH6JVgs.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iEUKsK0EzVjI4004HVSPnH6JVgs.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jFGEGclYTSm5M8TfKVyYF1uloox.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jFGEGclYTSm5M8TfKVyYF1uloox.jpg","language":"it","width":960,"height":1440},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ieP3KsZXdW2rWDQf6dG5SyFfAWh.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ieP3KsZXdW2rWDQf6dG5SyFfAWh.jpg","language":"it","width":683,"height":1024}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A168bF52vmAIGkC2Qafj7M2EmaE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A168bF52vmAIGkC2Qafj7M2EmaE.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A168bF52vmAIGkC2Qafj7M2EmaE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A168bF52vmAIGkC2Qafj7M2EmaE.jp